*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines/test_redefines_alias_roundtrip_to_base
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BASE PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-ALIAS REDEFINES WS-BASE PIC 9(4).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 77 TO WS-ALIAS.
    DISPLAY WS-BASE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-BASE DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0077"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0077] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

